<Component J2N3819>
  <Description>
J2N3819 N-Channel JFET (National Semiconductor) TO-92
General-purpose low-noise JFET. IDSS=2-20mA Vgs(off)=-0.5 to -8V VDS=25V
Popular in audio preamps, VFOs, mixer front ends.
Pins: 1=Gate 2=Drain 3=Source
  </Description>
  <Model>
.Def:JFET_Extended_J2N3819 _net0 _net1 _net2
Sub:X1 _net0 _net1 _net2 gnd Type="J2N3819_cir"
.Def:End
  </Model>
  <Spice>
.SUBCKT J2N3819_cir gnd _net0 _net1 _net2
J1 _net1 _net0 _net2 J2N3819M
.MODEL J2N3819M NJF(Beta=1.304m Betatce=-0.5 Rd=1 Rs=1
